{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん。ひなぴょん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/02/23/8645234/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月22日。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日乃木坂46は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー2周年をむかえました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/02/23/8645234/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの乃木坂46にとって大事な日を、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんと横浜アリーナという素敵な場所で一緒にお祝い出来て本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1stから7thまで全曲披露しました！✡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルが行われるという発表と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(卒業メンバー)せっちゃんとゆみ姉が登場するという2つのサプライズが起きたりもました。。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん・ゆみ姉だいすき♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとライブの合間にね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークの場面もあったんやけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで陽菜はあだ名の話をしたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/02/23/8645234/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/02/23/8645234/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミサミサに\"ビー玉ババア\"に変わる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いあだ名付けることになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付けたのが。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ビー玉ババアZ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！(ビー玉ババアの進化系)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳過ぎたらBBAって言われるのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉がいた時から始まってたから許してね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさーくるの皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怒らないで下さいね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークが一番不安やったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが反応してくれたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです( ´•̥ω•̥` )♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場にいる皆さんと目を合わせることが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目標だったんだけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうしてたらねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなめろさんいっぱい見つけちゃったよ\\( ˆ ˆ )/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけたら何だか安心できた(ฅωฅ//)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/02/23/8645234/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日を皆さんと共有できて最高でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また初めて友達がライブに来てくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「すごい良かったよ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれたのも嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",